    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RGB Athletes:\u00a0</strong>a team-based action and strategy MOBA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from athletes with unique skills in this sport based on your playstyle, and fight in a stadium equipped with advanced technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train to master your athlete in Zombie mode and improve your performance by surviving as many waves as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/19148d35de7b1a237ae742a11b8684df.poster.avif?t=1747215519\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/19148d35de7b1a237ae742a11b8684df.webm?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/19148d35de7b1a237ae742a11b8684df.mp4?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master your athlete</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All skills are dodgeable and each athlete has a unique combat tool, such as time control, light, magnetism, elasticity and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create athlete combinations to turn the tide of the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain elastic punches at lightning speed using the time acceleration of a white hole, or trap your opponents in flames with an octagon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/de774a16af8cba742236e4558b15b7ef.poster.avif?t=1747215519\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/de774a16af8cba742236e4558b15b7ef.webm?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/de774a16af8cba742236e4558b15b7ef.mp4?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules of sport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play up to 5v5, athletes are balanced with constant damage throughout the match, regardless of the score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all your opponents to win 3 rounds and take the victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy orbs to unlock your ultimates faster and gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one player can make the difference, there\u2019s always a chance to come back and win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/a3d32d923a4cbf29912e85437585c821.poster.avif?t=1747215519\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/a3d32d923a4cbf29912e85437585c821.webm?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/a3d32d923a4cbf29912e85437585c821.mp4?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and train in Zombie mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train solo or co-op against waves of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new types of zombies, such as robots, ghosts, or giants, to intensify and perfect your training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/e06feb5e88a66193f6e2965ec0f17b66.poster.avif?t=1747215519\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/e06feb5e88a66193f6e2965ec0f17b66.webm?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/e06feb5e88a66193f6e2965ec0f17b66.mp4?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RGB Athletes:\u00a0</strong>a team-based action and strategy MOBA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from athletes with unique skills in this sport based on your playstyle, and fight in a stadium equipped with advanced technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train to master your athlete in Zombie mode and improve your performance by surviving as many waves as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/19148d35de7b1a237ae742a11b8684df.poster.avif?t=1747215519\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/19148d35de7b1a237ae742a11b8684df.webm?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/19148d35de7b1a237ae742a11b8684df.mp4?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master your athlete</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All skills are dodgeable and each athlete has a unique combat tool, such as time control, light, magnetism, elasticity and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create athlete combinations to turn the tide of the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain elastic punches at lightning speed using the time acceleration of a white hole, or trap your opponents in flames with an octagon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/de774a16af8cba742236e4558b15b7ef.poster.avif?t=1747215519\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/de774a16af8cba742236e4558b15b7ef.webm?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/de774a16af8cba742236e4558b15b7ef.mp4?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules of sport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play up to 5v5, athletes are balanced with constant damage throughout the match, regardless of the score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all your opponents to win 3 rounds and take the victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy orbs to unlock your ultimates faster and gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one player can make the difference, there\u2019s always a chance to come back and win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/a3d32d923a4cbf29912e85437585c821.poster.avif?t=1747215519\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/a3d32d923a4cbf29912e85437585c821.webm?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/a3d32d923a4cbf29912e85437585c821.mp4?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and train in Zombie mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train solo or co-op against waves of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new types of zombies, such as robots, ghosts, or giants, to intensify and perfect your training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/e06feb5e88a66193f6e2965ec0f17b66.poster.avif?t=1747215519\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/e06feb5e88a66193f6e2965ec0f17b66.webm?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371180/extras/e06feb5e88a66193f6e2965ec0f17b66.mp4?t=1747215519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
